  <p class="body-text">Signature Therapeutic Wellness ("we," "us," "our") respects your privacy. This policy explains what information we collect through this website and how we use it.</p>

  <h2 class="page-section-title" style="margin-top:2.5rem;">Information We Collect</h2>
  <p class="body-text">When you contact us through this website or by email, we collect the information you provide, such as your name, email address, phone number, and any message content — including insurance card details you choose to send us for coverage verification.</p>

  <h2 class="page-section-title" style="margin-top:2.5rem;">Booking &amp; Payments</h2>
  <p class="body-text">Appointments and gift card purchases are processed through Square, a third-party payment and scheduling provider. Square's own privacy policy governs the information you provide during booking or checkout.</p>

  <h2 class="page-section-title" style="margin-top:2.5rem;">How We Use Your Information</h2>
  <p class="body-text">We use the information you provide to respond to inquiries, schedule appointments, verify insurance coverage, and communicate with you about your care. We do not sell your personal information.</p>

  <h2 class="page-section-title" style="margin-top:2.5rem;">Data Retention</h2>
  <p class="body-text">We retain client information for as long as necessary to provide services and meet recordkeeping obligations, including those required for insurance billing.</p>

  <h2 class="page-section-title" style="margin-top:2.5rem;">Your Choices</h2>
  <p class="body-text">You may ask us to update or delete the personal information we hold about you by contacting us using the details below.</p>

